## Setting

- Pacific Northwest **megacity** when the scene is urban (modern glass, highways, pines, rain, fog), or **desert metropolis** when requested (heat haze, mesas, sodium night light, dense arid sprawl).
- Highways should show **visible traffic** when the road is in frame; skyline should imply an ** enormous** city when possible.
- Photorealistic photography only — no illustration style unless the user asks otherwise.

